# issue #49 evidence archive: the raw solver outputs (.dat tecplot, stdout.log)
# must be versioned so the 135-entry sha256.json is reproducible from a clean clone.
!docs/issue49_vspaero/raw/*/*.dat
!docs/issue49_vspaero/ladders/*/stdout.log
!docs/issue49_vspaero/raw/*/stdout.log
